  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Affordable Off-Grid Connectivity Feasibility Study, through Vernonburg Group LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant funds a feasibility study (Study) to assess the economic and technical viability of Ilitha Telecommunications (Pty) Ltd&apos;s expansion of fixed wireless access network infrastructure in township communities with unreliable electricity access across South Africa. The Study would include a pilot of U.S. company MeshPlusPlus Inc.&apos;s solar-powered Wi-Fi solution in Mandela Park, a township in the O.R. Tambo District of the Eastern Cape Province. U.S. firm Vernonburg Group LLC will carry out the Study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
  </description>
